# Anyone a job is for (Docs/Design/83-dialogue-trees.md, Phase 2): a courier's letter handed over, a mission's goods or
# message handed in, and the thanks, with the pay said aloud. Talk with them opens it while the player carries something
# of theirs (here.deliveries), and so does the wheel's "Hand over the letter" or "Deliver ...". A letter taken in the
# dialogue window is handed over here, in words, not by standing near. Escorts, bounties and watches finish by
# themselves. The lines are talk concepts (dlg.receiver.<node>).

tree receiver
for here.deliveries>0
priority 5
entry talk greet
entry deliver greet

node greet
say #greet#. #receiver_ask# | #greet#. #talk_open# | #receiver_ask#
say[topic.meeting=returning priority=6] Well, well. I've not seen you since #topic.since#. #talk_open# | Look who it is. Not since #topic.since#! #talk_open#
say[topic.meeting=famous priority=6] You #topic.deed#, didn't you? Folk talk of it still. #talk_open# | So you're the one who #topic.deed#. #talk_open#
say[topic.meeting=famous_look priority=6] You look like the one who #topic.deed#. Are you? #talk_open# | I've heard of a wolf like you, who #topic.deed#. #talk_open#
say[pair.disposition=wary priority=3] Yes? | What is it you want? | #greet#. What is it?
say[pair.disposition=hostile priority=10] You. Say what you want and go. | What now? | What do you want?
free
each job in here.deliveries max 3
choice #job.handover# [topic.job_ready=yes] locked "#job.why#" -> do deliver job.id ; then paid ; refused refused
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node paid
say #work_paid# #topic.job_paid.capitalize#.
say[topic.job_kind=courier] A letter, for me? Thank you. #topic.job_paid.capitalize#, as #topic.job_poster# promised. | From #topic.job_poster#? Thank you kindly. #topic.job_paid.capitalize#, as promised.
say[topic.job_paid=nothing priority=2] Thank you. There's no pay left in it today, I'm afraid.
mood pleased
free
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node refused
say #topic.why# | Hm. #topic.why#
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node bye
say #farewell#. | #farewell#, #address#.
end
